  <string id="st_bm_delivery_comment_1">
    <text>Do not lose it. We will not get another one.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_delivery_comment_2">
    <text>It works. Tested on a live target.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_delivery_comment_3">
    <text>No one saw a thing. You never saw it, and we do not know you.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_delivery_comment_4">
    <text>For that kind of money, you could at least bow.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_delivery_comment_5">
    <text>No tracks. Pretend it appeared by itself.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_delivery_comment_6">
