  <string id="st_bm_greet_1">
    <text>What do you want? The stock is right in front of you. Do not hang around.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_greet_2">
    <text>Oh, it is you again. Do you have money this time?</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_greet_3">
    <text>Come in. Just do not pull any stunts like last time.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_greet_4">
    <text>Hey, wanderer. Are you here on business or just passing by?</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_greet_5">
    <text>Long time no see. How have you been?</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_greet_6">
    <text>Hey. Look what came in today.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_greet_7">
    <text>You came. Good. There is something to discuss later.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_greet_8">
    <text>We were just waiting for you. See what we set aside.</text>
  </string>
  <string id="st_bm_greet_9">
    <text>The boss is here. The stock is yours; take what you want.</text>
  </string>
